# iOS / local Vite: cloud-connect against the PROD Portal on purpose — core-3,
# the account the device-connect flow is exercised with, lives on hub.ci.computer
# and not on the dev Portal. Keep this explicit rather than relying on the
# fallback: this file is loaded only for `mode === 'development'`, so a
# store-bound `vite build` never sees it, and deleting the line leaves you on
# production too.
#
# There is deliberately no way to aim this client at the internal
# hub.companionintelligence.com Portal: `portalUrlFromEnv` ignores a baked value
# on that host and `readPersistedPortalUrl` ignores a stored one, so a shipped
# artifact cannot be pointed at it by a build flag or by a runtime setting. See
# the resolution order documented in src/pages/DeviceConnectPage/portal-client.ts.
VITE_CI_CLOUD_URL=https://hub.ci.computer
